function weeklyPlan(state){const courses=currentLevelCourses(state),recommended=recommendedRoute(state),recommendedId=recommended.course,weak=weakestSkill(state),weakName=weak&&weak[0],preferred=weakName==='kanji'?courses.find(id=>id.includes('kanji')):weakName==='vocabulary'?courses.find(id=>id.includes('vocabulary')||id==='basic_words'):weakName==='grammar'||weakName==='reading'?courses.find(id=>id.includes('grammar')):null,rotation=[recommendedId,preferred,...courses].filter((id,index,array)=>id&&courseRoutes[id]&&array.indexOf(id)===index),sessions=state.sessions||[];return Array.from({length:7},(_,index)=>{const date=new Date();date.setDate(date.getDate()+index);const id=rotation[index%rotation.length],route=courseRoutes[id],dateKey=date.toLocaleDateString('en-CA'),completed=sessions.some(session=>session.course.replace(/-/g,'_')===id&&new Date(session.completedAt).toLocaleDateString('en-CA')===dateKey);return{index,date,id,route,completed,review:index===3||index===6};});}
function defaultState(){return{version:2,profile:null,assessment:null,sessions:[],lastCourse:null,learning:{records:[],courses:{},streak:{count:0,lastDate:null}}};}
function loadState(){try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY));if(!saved||saved.version!==2)return defaultState();const state={...defaultState(),...saved};state.learning={...defaultState().learning,...(saved.learning||{})};state.learning.records=Array.isArray(state.learning.records)?state.learning.records:[];state.learning.courses=state.learning.courses||{};return state;}catch(_){return defaultState();}}
function saveState(state){try{localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY,JSON.stringify(state));}catch(_){}}
function importDraMapPlan(){
  const query=new URLSearchParams(location.search);
  if(!['dramap','transfer'].includes(query.get('from')))return false;
  const state=loadState(),course=query.get('course'),goal=query.get('goal'),level=query.get('level'),minutes=Number(query.get('minutes')),streak=Number(query.get('streak')),answered=Number(query.get('answered')),sessions=Number(query.get('sessions')),weak=query.get('weak')||'',todayAnswered=Number(query.get('todayAnswered')),todayAccuracy=Number(query.get('todayAccuracy')),todayWeakRaw=query.get('todayWeak')||'',todayWeak=['kana','vocabulary','kanji','grammar','reading'].includes(todayWeakRaw)?todayWeakRaw:'';
  state.profile={...(state.profile||{}),goal:goalProfiles[goal]?goal:(state.profile?.goal||'daily'),minutes:Number.isFinite(minutes)?Math.min(180,Math.max(3,minutes)):(state.profile?.minutes||10),weeklyTarget:state.profile?.weeklyTarget||5};
  if(level&&routes[level])state.assessment={...(state.assessment||{}),estimatedLevel:level,recommendedCourse:courseRoutes[course]?course:routes[level].course,skills:state.assessment?.skills||{},completedAt:state.assessment?.completedAt||new Date().toISOString(),importedFromDraMap:true};
  else if(courseRoutes[course])state.assessment={...(state.assessment||{}),estimatedLevel:state.assessment?.estimatedLevel||'Foundation',recommendedCourse:course,skills:state.assessment?.skills||{},completedAt:state.assessment?.completedAt||new Date().toISOString(),importedFromDraMap:true};
  if(Number.isFinite(streak)&&streak>0)state.learning={...state.learning,streak:{...(state.learning?.streak||{}),count:Math.max(state.learning?.streak?.count||0,streak)}};
  state.bridgeSummary={answered:Number.isFinite(answered)?Math.max(0,answered):0,sessions:Number.isFinite(sessions)?Math.max(0,sessions):0,weak,todayAnswered:Number.isFinite(todayAnswered)?Math.max(0,todayAnswered):0,todayAccuracy:Number.isFinite(todayAccuracy)?Math.max(0,Math.min(100,todayAccuracy)):0,todayWeak};
  state.importedFromDraMapAt=new Date().toISOString();saveState(state);
  history.replaceState({},document.title,location.pathname+location.hash);
  return true;
}
function absolute(href){return new URL(href,siteRoot).href;}
function guestProgressSummary(state){const courses=Object.values(state.learning?.courses||{}),answered=courses.reduce((sum,item)=>sum+Number(item.attempts||0),0),weak=weakestSkill(state);return{answered,sessions:(state.sessions||[]).length,streak:state.learning?.streak?.count||0,weak:weak?.[0]||''};}
function dramapPlanURL(courseId,state=loadState(),item=''){const route=courseId||recommendedRoute(state).course,params=new URLSearchParams({course:route,source:item?'web_review':'web'}),level=state.assessment?.estimatedLevel,goal=state.profile?.goal,minutes=state.profile?.minutes,summary=guestProgressSummary(state);if(level)params.set('level',level);if(goal)params.set('goal',goal);if(minutes)params.set('minutes',String(minutes));if(summary.streak)params.set('streak',String(summary.streak));if(summary.answered)params.set('answered',String(summary.answered));if(summary.sessions)params.set('sessions',String(summary.sessions));if(summary.weak)params.set('weak',summary.weak);if(item){params.set('review','1');params.set('item',item);}return DRAMAP_SCHEME+'?'+params.toString();}
function webRouteURL(route){const url=new URL(route.href,siteRoot);if(route.mode==='review'){url.searchParams.set('review','1');if(route.item)url.searchParams.set('item',route.item);}return url.href;}
function routeForCourse(courseId){const route=courseRoutes[courseId];return route?{course:courseId,...route,reason:'A scheduled review is ready before this memory fades.'}:null;}
function dueRecords(state){const now=Date.now();return (state.learning?.records||[]).filter(record=>record.dueAt&&record.dueAt<=now).sort((a,b)=>a.dueAt-b.dueAt);}
function weakestSkill(state){const totals={};Object.entries(state.assessment?.skills||{}).forEach(([skill,value])=>{totals[skill]={attempts:value.total||0,correct:value.correct||0};});Object.values(state.learning?.courses||{}).forEach(course=>Object.entries(course.skills||{}).forEach(([skill,value])=>{const total=totals[skill]||(totals[skill]={attempts:0,correct:0});total.attempts+=value.attempts||0;total.correct+=value.correct||0;}));return Object.entries(totals).filter(([,value])=>value.attempts>0&&value.correct/value.attempts<.85).sort((a,b)=>(a[1].correct/a[1].attempts)-(b[1].correct/b[1].attempts)||b[1].attempts-a[1].attempts)[0]||null;}
function recommendedRoute(state){const due=dueRecords(state)[0],reviewRoute=due&&routeForCourse(due.courseId);if(reviewRoute)return{...reviewRoute,reason:'A scheduled '+due.skill+' review is ready now.',mode:'review',item:due.item};const imported=routeForCourse(state.assessment?.recommendedCourse);if(imported)return{...imported,reason:'This is the next course carried over from your DraMap plan.'};return routes[state.assessment?.estimatedLevel]||routes.Hiragana;}
function todayMinutes(state){return Number(state.profile?.minutes||10);}
function daysSince(iso){return iso?Math.floor((Date.now()-new Date(iso).getTime())/86400000):999;}
function dailyPlan(state){const route=recommendedRoute(state),due=dueRecords(state),weak=weakestSkill(state),last=(state.sessions||[]).slice(-1)[0],comeback=daysSince(last?.completedAt)>=2,minutes=comeback?3:todayMinutes(state),weakLabel=weak?weak[0].replace(/^./,letter=>letter.toUpperCase()):null;return{route,due,weak,minutes,comeback,why:comeback?'A three-minute restart lowers the barrier. Finishing today matters more than catching up.':due.length?'This review is due now. Returning before it fades will save time later.':weakLabel?'Your '+weakLabel.toLowerCase()+' result is the current bottleneck, so today keeps it in focus.':'This course matches your current level and keeps the next step small.',steps:[{label:due.length?'Review':'Warm up',minutes:Math.max(2,Math.round(minutes*.3)),copy:due.length?due.length+' item'+(due.length===1?' is':'s are')+' ready now.':'Begin with familiar material.'},{label:weakLabel?'Focus on '+weakLabel:'Core training',minutes:Math.max(2,Math.round(minutes*.5)),copy:weakLabel?'Work on the skill slowing you down.':'Build the course skill directly.'},{label:'Quick finish',minutes:Math.max(1,minutes-Math.round(minutes*.3)-Math.round(minutes*.5)),copy:'Save the result and schedule the next review.'}]};}

